#before peer lock-on
# Safe mode turned on by alice's other device (the owner's, a signer) with this app's device left out: in Home's place
# the app shows that it waits to be approved (not its stations offline); 发送批准请求 reaches the other device, which
# shows a code for it under this app's own name (still.fail mbui); a wrong code typed says how many tries are left.
# Safe mode off again after: Home comes back. (Last of the flows: the others run with safe mode off.)
timeout 120000
until 等待批准此设备
until 发送批准请求
shot 1-waiting
log do: peer lock-await 60
wait 3000
tap 发送批准请求
until 输入你的受信任设备上显示的安全码
shot 2-code
type 000000
until 安全码不对
shot 3-wrong
wait 15000
log do: peer lock-off
until 端到端测试
shot 4-home
